cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Original Bitcoin Laboratory — Common (conformance and definitions)"
abstract: >-
  The shared foundation of the Original Bitcoin Laboratory: the definitional and
  conformance layer under both editions (the 15 November 2008 pre-release and the
  January 2009 release, distributed as v0.1.0 with v0.1.1 contents). Argues what "Bitcoin" and a "satoshi" are from the
  artifacts rather than from prose, records the consensus surface and cross-version
  diffs, and states which claims are machine-checkable and which are convention.
  A research and teaching instrument, not money. Experimental; findings are provisional.
type: software
